        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Recto",
          "value": "<p><i>Registration mark on right</i></p>\n\n<ol><li>[Let it be registered on behalf of the office o]f supervision,</li>\n<li>if God wills.</li></ol>\n",
