        "selector": {
          "type": "FragmentSelector",
          "value": "xywh=pixel:431.5277404785156,708.8236083984375,1735.7984313964844,2158.1612548828125",
          "conformsTo": "http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/"
        }
      },
      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "value": "<p><i>Registration mark on left</i></p>\n\n<ol><li dir=\"ltr\">Let it be registered in the office of accounts,</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">if God wills.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[They have registered the amount of] two, a quarter and a sixth.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">Praise be to God for his bounties.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">In the name of God, the merciful and compassionate.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">A valid receipt has been granted to \u02beAb\u016b al-\u1e24asan ibn Wahb for the sum owed through his standing surety for the estates in the town of al-Fayy\u016bm for the year four-hundred and three,</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">under the supervision of the auspicious, rightly-guided judge, \u1e6eiqat al-Mulk Mak\u012bn al-Dawla wa-\u02beAm\u012bnuh\u0101, the prot\u00e9g\u00e9 of the commander of the faithful,</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\u02beAb\u016b al-\u1e24asan \u02bfAl\u012b ibn Bah\u0101r, with \u02beAb\u016b al-Sar\u012b Theodor ibn Yu\u1e25annis acting as accountant.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">Half of this: One, an eighth and two q\u012br\u0101ts (= a twelfth). Its amount: Two, a quarter and a sixth.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">Written by M\u012b\u1e35\u0101\u02be\u012bl ibn \u02bfAbd al-Mas\u012b\u1e25, the cashier. Valid. The beginning of \u1e0e\u016b al-\u1e24ijja,</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">in the year four-hundred and three.</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
        "sc:supplementing",
        "translating"
      ],
